    {
      "source": "Create a stateful builder for creating <a href=\"WebClientStreamableHttpTransport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.mcp.client.webflux.transport\"><code>WebClientStreamableHttpTransport</code></a>\ninstances.",
      "translation": "创建一个用于构建<a href=\"WebClientStreamableHttpTransport.html\" title=\"org.springframework.ai.mcp.client.webflux.transport 中的类\"><code>WebClientStreamableHttpTransport</code></a>实例的状态感知构建器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This implementation does not handle backwards compatibility with the <a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2024-11-05/basic/transports#http-with-sse\">\"HTTP\nwith SSE\" transport</a>. In order to communicate over the phased-out\n<code>2024-11-05</code> protocol, use <code>HttpClientSseClientTransport</code> or\n<a href=\"WebFluxSseClientTransport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.mcp.client.webflux.transport\"><code>WebFluxSseClientTransport</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此实现不支持与<a href=\"https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/2024-11-05/basic/transports#http-with-sse\">\"HTTP with SSE\"传输</a>的向后兼容。若要使用已弃用的<code>2024-11-05</code>协议进行通信，请使用<code>HttpClientSseClientTransport</code>或<a href=\"WebFluxSseClientTransport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.mcp.client.webflux.transport\"><code>WebFluxSseClientTransport</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
